Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.70,0:00:04.91,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,What if the difference between \Nbeing good or bad at a subject
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.91,0:00:07.88,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,isn't a matter of knowing the right answers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:11.78,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,but rather a matter of knowing \Nhow to find the right answers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.83,0:00:17.20,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,When you're bad at a subject, it's hard to \Nfind helpful sample questions in textbooks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:19.31,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,or search for them online.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:23.03,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,So what should you do in that situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.73,0:00:27.21,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,A few months ago, I don't think I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.75,0:00:30.50,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,But now I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:33.35,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,The answer is to rely on someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.93,0:00:37.14,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Admit your shortcomings \Nand ask someone to teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:42.39,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Then learn their shortcomings and see if \Nyou can teach them something in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.88,0:00:45.52,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Give and take.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.92,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I was familiar with the concept, \Nbut I think I understand it better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.82,0:00:55.04,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Leaning on other people is a skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.88,0:01:02.17,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,We can't read each other's minds, \Nso if you don't tell anyone what you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.17,0:01:03.64,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,they're left in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.30,0:01:06.96,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,It isn't fair to make them guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.38,0:01:14.74,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,If you want to ask for something, \Nyou should say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.74,0:01:18.52,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,If we could learn to understand each other's\N feelings and compromise more,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.52,0:01:20.25,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,everyone would be happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:22.46,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,That's what I believe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.18,0:01:30.25,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,But I've been violating my own policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.11,0:01:36.76,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,There's one person I need to cooperate \Nand share my honest feelings with...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.57,0:01:41.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(650,640)\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H8678DF&\b1\pos(320,162.606)}Episode 12 {\fs14}"\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h{\c&H89CAEB&}and{\c&H8678DF&}\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.69,0:01:40.06,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,but I still can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.11,0:01:46.71,Default,Employee,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.95,0:01:53.88,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Why don't you put some of that in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.88,0:01:57.71,Default,Keisuke,0,0,0,,Hmm? Okay, can you take this, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.69,0:01:59.79,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.63,0:02:02.50,Default,Keisuke,0,0,0,,You've got enough to carry already.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.95,0:02:08.66,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You're a real gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.66,0:02:12.43,Default,Keisuke,0,0,0,,I'm really not. My little sister's just\N always on my case about that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:14.88,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You have a little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.88,0:02:17.22,Default,Keisuke,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.63,0:02:25.80,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Sorry. What were you just saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:32.13,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,I wasn't saying anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.13,0:02:33.21,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You weren't?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.46,0:02:35.58,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Um, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.58,0:02:38.10,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,You don't need to force a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.21,0:02:43.48,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,This is exactly why I'm worried \Nabout you, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:54.06,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,The way you looked when \Nyou showed up yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.57,0:02:59.36,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,You had this expression like you\N were running from something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.00,0:03:06.71,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,It's a look that I'm very familiar \Nwith, so it bothered me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.67,0:03:12.03,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,You were actually studying, \Nso you weren't there to hit on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.68,0:03:17.70,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,which means you were \Nprobably looking for sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.07,0:03:24.37,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Would you mind if I ordered some pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:25.01,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.87,0:03:28.39,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,The pudding here is crazy good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:35.22,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Do your problems have \Nsomething to do with love?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.93,0:03:36.88,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.43,0:03:41.04,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,It all makes sense if you came\N seeking refuge with another girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:46.66,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,As if searching for a new love \Nto escape a painful experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:56.55,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,The problem is... I fell for someone \Nthat I never should've fallen for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.69,0:04:01.85,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,And if I got what I want now, it would \Ncause problems for everyone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:04.54,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I know I need to forget the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.79,0:04:10.64,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But I don't think I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.07,0:04:14.64,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,That sounds serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:21.86,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Do you have time after cram school?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.07,0:04:28.36,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Let's hit the town tonight. \NI want you to come out with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:51.53,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:53.85,Default,Keisuke,0,0,0,,I really like you, Ayase.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:04:58.70,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.69,0:05:05.43,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm glad... that you told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.97,0:05:08.27,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.39,0:05:18.58,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't think I'll ever be \Nable to see you that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.41,0:05:23.78,Default,Keisuke,0,0,0,,Are you going out with someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:25.50,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.61,0:05:28.96,Default,Keisuke,0,0,0,,Do you have a crush on anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:31.27,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No, I... don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:34.88,Default,Keisuke,0,0,0,,But it still wouldn't work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.26,0:05:37.91,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It still wouldn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.49,0:05:46.97,Default,Keisuke,0,0,0,,Sorry. I won't bother you about it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.11,0:05:50.07,Default,Keisuke,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:03.84,Flashback - Italics,Kudo,0,0,0,,If you connect with another \Nperson you're attracted to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.34,0:06:07.27,Flashback - Italics,Kudo,0,0,0,,and your feelings remain unchanged,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:10.84,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1890)\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\bord0\an1\c&H6B6C99&\b1\3c&H3E3D33&\pos(28.085,128.154)}Sorry, Ayase-san.\NI have to go somewhere, so I'll be home late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.39,0:06:14.38,Flashback - Italics,Kudo,0,0,0,,then those are your true feelings, \Nand you should always treasure them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:27.95,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Don't all those people look lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.61,0:06:29.31,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.37,0:06:36.00,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,When I walk around the city, I feel like\Neveryone in the world is living a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:41.72,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,But I think that's the only way \Nsome people know how to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.21,0:06:48.49,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,I was one of them. In middle school, \NI was among all these useless people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:53.72,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Why are you telling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.04,0:07:00.79,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Because you remind me of \Nmy old self, and it pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.05,0:07:04.56,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,You were raised without anyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.19,0:07:10.00,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,I mean, without any women \Nyou could count on, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:18.42,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,You're able to face things objectively.\N That's a real gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:23.56,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,But if I had to guess how you developed that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.62,0:07:27.44,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,I'd say it's because you grew up\Nwithout a woman to depend on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:33.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Was it the same for you, Fujinami-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.01,0:07:36.83,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:40.24,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,But I lost my faith in humanity as a whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.93,0:07:48.16,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,I lost both of my parents in an accident \Nwhen I was in middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:54.50,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,I found out that both of their families \Nhad opposed their marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:08:02.18,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Everyone mocked them at the funeral, \Nsaying they got what they asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:15.80,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,The emotion that came over me at \Nthe time wasn't hatred or sadness...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.39,0:08:23.29,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,but a sense of resignation. Of giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.06,0:08:33.31,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Ah, what a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.03,0:08:37.87,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Tonight's the harvest moon, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.41,0:08:44.96,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,You say you have no faith in women,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:47.90,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,but I think that's a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.81,0:08:55.60,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Until my auntie set me straight, \NI was so sure of the way I felt, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.61,0:08:57.64,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Your auntie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:08:59.62,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,We're family now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.19,0:09:05.34,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,She was worried about me staying out \Nall night and had the heart to adopt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.73,0:09:11.19,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,She told me something \Nthe day I moved in with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:16.73,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,"You should try a little harder to make \Npeace with your heart," she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:23.61,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,To reconcile, or maybe more like compromise...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:29.04,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,She said, "Don't ignore your feelings."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.33,0:09:35.63,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,"You think you've given up," she said. \N"But are you sure you have?"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.75,0:09:41.78,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,"I think you really did have faith in people,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:45.91,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,but you feel that faith was betrayed."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:52.56,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,"It must have been so painful for you."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:54.40,Flashback - Italics,Young Kaho,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:56.05,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,When I heard that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.05,0:09:57.15,Flashback - Italics,Young Kaho,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.15,0:09:59.32,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,I guess I, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.42,0:10:04.34,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,I think I spent the whole night crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.65,0:10:19.04,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Asamura-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:25.51,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Do you think you might be trying to \Nbottle up and suffocate your feelings, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:32.16,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,The feelings I have...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.97,0:10:34.81,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I can't let out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:38.14,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Well, that would be fine
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.14,0:10:41.80,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,if suppressing them would make \Nthem disappear one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:49.31,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,But being objective and expecting nothing \Nfrom people are two different things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:54.23,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,I mean, we're all human.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:57.74,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,We can't help having expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.53,0:11:12.75,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Deceive your heart all you want, but if \Nyou don't resolve this, it will scorn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.26,0:11:16.56,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,And before you know it, \Nyou'll be scarred forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.89,0:11:20.95,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But I can't be that selfish...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.95,0:11:24.95,Default,Kaho,0,0,0,,Yes, you can. Feelings are selfish things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:42.55,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(810,1)\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs14\3c&H444242&\c&HECE6D3&\pos(157.49,164.45)}Monday, September 28th
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.23,0:11:56.25,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You know, I think I saw you \Nyesterday, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:11:57.05,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:12:03.29,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Near my cram school. \NWere you shopping at the store there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:05.62,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:09.00,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I was at the restaurant across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.98,0:12:14.40,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I think... you were with a guy who \Nlooked like a classmate or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.48,0:12:17.07,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,That was Shinjo-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:21.11,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh. I couldn't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.65,0:12:24.54,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Now can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.05,0:12:26.00,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:30.33,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You were out late last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.82,0:12:33.55,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Where were you, Big Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.55,0:12:35.73,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I was walking around Shibuya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.00,0:12:40.20,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Just walking? Uh... with Yomiuri-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.20,0:12:42.23,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,No, someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.23,0:12:45.74,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Remember when I said I was going\Nto lunch with someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:46.33,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That was—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.33,0:12:47.06,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.60,0:12:52.52,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Are we talking about a girl here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.37,0:12:55.45,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Um, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:59.85,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, okay. And?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.49,0:13:02.34,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.59,0:13:06.90,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It gave me a chance to think about things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.13,0:13:13.99,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,So I want to work something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.18,0:13:19.15,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Work what out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:26.80,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Listen, Ayase-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:31.66,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I think I have very strong feelings for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.65,0:13:37.54,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.04,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.99,0:13:41.17,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Are you joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.17,0:13:43.82,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Do you think I'd make such a cruel joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:47.50,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No, you're right. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.50,0:13:50.51,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You'd never do something \Nso heartless, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:53.96,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Did you just call me Asamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:56.71,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.14,0:14:02.57,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You said you have strong feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.85,0:14:07.67,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Like, I really like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.85,0:14:13.54,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You mean as my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.26,0:14:19.48,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Or as in... you want to touch \Nme and hold me and stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:25.06,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Like, you get jealous when you see me \Nwith other boys? Those kinds of feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:27.05,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.78,0:14:31.98,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But siblings can feel that way, too, can't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:32.73,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:34.10,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I mean, of course they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.65,0:14:35.39,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.39,0:14:38.58,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I heard that when someone's starved \Nfor attention from the opposite sex
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:41.29,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,and suddenly gets a lot of time with them,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.29,0:14:44.40,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,it's easy to develop feelings they could \Nconfuse with romantic attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.61,0:14:48.25,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's just one possibility, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.25,0:14:50.02,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,We can't rule it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.02,0:14:52.06,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.06,0:14:55.37,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Maybe just you have stronger than \Nnormal feelings for me as your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.70,0:14:57.46,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Could that explain it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.99,0:15:08.13,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.13,0:15:09.28,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:39.14,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm okay with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.05,0:17:03.96,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Does this help?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.31,0:17:13.04,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thank you for having the courage to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.57,0:17:18.23,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,If you'd kept that bottled up,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.95,0:17:21.26,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,it would've been so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.11,0:17:24.74,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,It really would have weighed on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.53,0:17:33.48,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.35,0:17:40.28,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I think I can help you carry that weight, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.85,0:17:50.04,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Whether you have feelings for me \Nas my brother or something more,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.40,0:17:53.86,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm okay with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:18:00.70,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Whichever it is, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.71,0:18:05.56,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.83,0:18:10.62,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm not sure myself
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.48,0:18:16.35,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,if the feelings I have for you are because \Nyou're my brother or... something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.98,0:18:24.62,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But if I can give you some comfort by \Nhugging you, I truly want to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:33.67,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,And if you could hug me when I need it,\Nit'd truly make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.00,0:18:39.23,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,So let's compromise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.98,0:18:42.78,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't want to cause any \Ntrouble for our parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.55,0:18:48.14,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah. I honestly want them both to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.61,0:19:00.31,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,If I know you're with other girls, \NI might get jealous and anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:02.47,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.10,0:19:04.09,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Same goes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.06,0:19:08.80,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I wasn't... thrilled about the study session.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.50,0:19:12.51,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.06,0:19:18.92,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But you know, that kind of \Njealousy isn't only between lovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.42,0:19:22.34,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I think it can happen between siblings, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.24,0:19:25.61,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,So, Asamura-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.86,0:19:32.88,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,in front of anyone else, \Nwe need to stay just brother and sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.60,0:19:40.56,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,even if we're not really brother and sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:49.15,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Together, we can carry this weight...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.24,0:19:51.51,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,as two special...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.89,0:19:56.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,especially close...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.09,0:20:05.05,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:17.27,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.06,0:20:22.01,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,From now on, Ayase-san, I'll count on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.85,0:20:27.49,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,So I want you to know you can count on me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.90,0:20:32.41,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Let's... figure this out together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.25,0:20:39.47,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Let's protect what we have
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.85,0:20:42.07,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,and figure this out...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.21,0:20:44.86,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.09,0:20:51.54,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.46,0:21:00.52,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Yesterday, we were still only strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.47,0:21:05.03,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,And this is the story of how we became...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:08.84,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,a true family.
